    - target: {fileID: 6552091658511270362, guid: 7d8d4715d5a45ed438cddd3033525297, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.size
      value: 6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6552091658511270362, guid: 7d8d4715d5a45ed438cddd3033525297, type: 3}
      propertyPath: susClips.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6552091658511270362, guid: 7d8d4715d5a45ed438cddd3033525297, type: 3}
      propertyPath: waypoints.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6552091658511270362, guid: 7d8d4715d5a45ed438cddd3033525297, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[0]'
      value: Good day sir. And might I say, that is a fine coat you're wearing.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6552091658511270362, guid: 7d8d4715d5a45ed438cddd3033525297, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[1]'
      value: 'Welcome to this state of the art showhome for your viewing pleasure.
        We''re confident this time that these homes will have lower emissions and
        mortality rates than our previous endeavours. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6552091658511270362, guid: 7d8d4715d5a45ed438cddd3033525297, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[2]'
      value: This is the living room. What it lacks in space, it makes up for in
        the asking price. There was a generous attempt at storage space, inspect
        the cupboard and you'll see what I mean.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6552091658511270362, guid: 7d8d4715d5a45ed438cddd3033525297, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[3]'
      value: If you'll follow me into the kitchen. You'll find it clean, contemporary
        and entirely hygienic. There were rumours of a raccoon problem in this area,
        but I assure you they've been dealt with. There's not a raccoon within a
        hundred miles of this house. So relax, take a look in the fridge, it's entirely
        possible it's included in the price.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6552091658511270362, guid: 7d8d4715d5a45ed438cddd3033525297, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[4]'
      value: If you'll join me in the bedroom, this is where the magic happens. If
        by magic you mean how it's managed to pass the minimum requirements for building
        standards. It's four walls and a bed, no guarantees on the ceiling. But it
        does have a wardrobe. Why not take a look inside?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6552091658511270362, guid: 7d8d4715d5a45ed438cddd3033525297, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[5]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6552091658511270362, guid: 7d8d4715d5a45ed438cddd3033525297, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'susClips.Array.data[0]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eba089182b12da34298bc862fecd3c1f, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6552091658511270362, guid: 7d8d4715d5a45ed438cddd3033525297, type: 3}
